{"page":20,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:127","surah":2,"ayah":127,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذْ يَرْفَعُ إِبْرَٰهِـۧمُ ٱلْقَوَاعِدَ مِنَ ٱلْبَيْتِ وَإِسْمَـٰعِيلُ رَبَّنَا تَقَبَّلْ مِنَّآ ۖ إِنَّكَ أَنتَ ٱلسَّمِيعُ ٱلْعَلِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"As Abraham and Ishmael built up the foundations of the House [they prayed], ‘Our Lord, accept [this] from us. You are the All Hearing, the All Knowing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذْ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idh","verse_key":"2:127"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَرْفَعُ","en_gloss":"(was) raising","transliteration":"yarfaʿu","verse_key":"2:127"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِبْرَٰهِـۧمُ","en_gloss":"Ibrahim","transliteration":"ib'rāhīmu","verse_key":"2:127"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْقَوَاعِدَ","en_gloss":"the foundations","transliteration":"l-qawāʿida","verse_key":"2:127"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"2:127"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْبَيْتِ","en_gloss":"the House","transliteration":"l-bayti","verse_key":"2:127"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَإِسْمَـٰعِيلُ","en_gloss":"and Ishmael","transliteration":"wa-is'māʿīlu","verse_key":"2:127"},{"pos":8,"ar":"رَبَّنَا","en_gloss":"(saying), \"Our Lord","transliteration":"rabbanā","verse_key":"2:127"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَقَبَّلْ","en_gloss":"Accept","transliteration":"taqabbal","verse_key":"2:127"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِنَّآ ۖ","en_gloss":"from us","transliteration":"minnā","verse_key":"2:127"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِنَّكَ","en_gloss":"Indeed You","transliteration":"innaka","verse_key":"2:127"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَنتَ","en_gloss":"[You] (are)","transliteration":"anta","verse_key":"2:127"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلسَّمِيعُ","en_gloss":"the All-Hearing","transliteration":"l-samīʿu","verse_key":"2:127"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْعَلِيمُ","en_gloss":"the All-Knowing","transliteration":"l-ʿalīmu","verse_key":"2:127"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١٢٧","en_gloss":"(127)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:127"}]},{"verse_key":"2:128","surah":2,"ayah":128,"ar_uthmani":"رَبَّنَا وَٱجْعَلْنَا مُسْلِمَيْنِ لَكَ وَمِن ذُرِّيَّتِنَآ أُمَّةً مُّسْلِمَةً لَّكَ وَأَرِنَا مَنَاسِكَنَا وَتُبْ عَلَيْنَآ ۖ إِنَّكَ أَنتَ ٱلتَّوَّابُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Our Lord, make us devoted to You; make our descendants into a community devoted to You. Show us how to worship and accept our repentance, for You are the Ever Relenting, the Most Merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"رَبَّنَا","en_gloss":"Our Lord","transliteration":"rabbanā","verse_key":"2:128"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَٱجْعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"[and] Make us","transliteration":"wa-ij'ʿalnā","verse_key":"2:128"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مُسْلِمَيْنِ","en_gloss":"both submissive","transliteration":"mus'limayni","verse_key":"2:128"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَكَ","en_gloss":"to You","transliteration":"laka","verse_key":"2:128"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَمِن","en_gloss":"And from","transliteration":"wamin","verse_key":"2:128"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ذُرِّيَّتِنَآ","en_gloss":"our offspring","transliteration":"dhurriyyatinā","verse_key":"2:128"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أُمَّةًۭ","en_gloss":"a community","transliteration":"ummatan","verse_key":"2:128"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مُّسْلِمَةًۭ","en_gloss":"submissive","transliteration":"mus'limatan","verse_key":"2:128"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَّكَ","en_gloss":"to You","transliteration":"laka","verse_key":"2:128"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَأَرِنَا","en_gloss":"And show us","transliteration":"wa-arinā","verse_key":"2:128"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَنَاسِكَنَا","en_gloss":"our ways of worship","transliteration":"manāsikanā","verse_key":"2:128"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَتُبْ","en_gloss":"and turn","transliteration":"watub","verse_key":"2:128"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَلَيْنَآ ۖ","en_gloss":"to us","transliteration":"ʿalaynā","verse_key":"2:128"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِنَّكَ","en_gloss":"Indeed You","transliteration":"innaka","verse_key":"2:128"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أَنتَ","en_gloss":"[You] (are)","transliteration":"anta","verse_key":"2:128"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلتَّوَّابُ","en_gloss":"the Oft-returning","transliteration":"l-tawābu","verse_key":"2:128"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلرَّحِيمُ","en_gloss":"the Most Merciful","transliteration":"l-raḥīmu","verse_key":"2:128"},{"pos":18,"ar":"١٢٨","en_gloss":"(128)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:128"}]},{"verse_key":"2:129","surah":2,"ayah":129,"ar_uthmani":"رَبَّنَا وَٱبْعَثْ فِيهِمْ رَسُولًا مِّنْهُمْ يَتْلُوا۟ عَلَيْهِمْ ءَايَـٰتِكَ وَيُعَلِّمُهُمُ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ وَٱلْحِكْمَةَ وَيُزَكِّيهِمْ ۚ إِنَّكَ أَنتَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلْحَكِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Our Lord, make a messenger of their own rise up from among them, to recite Your revelations to them, teach them the Scripture and wisdom, and purify them: You are the Mighty, the Wise.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"رَبَّنَا","en_gloss":"Our Lord","transliteration":"rabbanā","verse_key":"2:129"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَٱبْعَثْ","en_gloss":"[And] raise up","transliteration":"wa-ib'ʿath","verse_key":"2:129"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِيهِمْ","en_gloss":"in them","transliteration":"fīhim","verse_key":"2:129"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَسُولًۭا","en_gloss":"a Messenger","transliteration":"rasūlan","verse_key":"2:129"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِّنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"from them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"2:129"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَتْلُوا۟","en_gloss":"(who) will recite","transliteration":"yatlū","verse_key":"2:129"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"2:129"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِكَ","en_gloss":"Your Verses","transliteration":"āyātika","verse_key":"2:129"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَيُعَلِّمُهُمُ","en_gloss":"and will teach them","transliteration":"wayuʿallimuhumu","verse_key":"2:129"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitāba","verse_key":"2:129"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱلْحِكْمَةَ","en_gloss":"and the wisdom","transliteration":"wal-ḥik'mata","verse_key":"2:129"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَيُزَكِّيهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"and purify them","transliteration":"wayuzakkīhim","verse_key":"2:129"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِنَّكَ","en_gloss":"Indeed You","transliteration":"innaka","verse_key":"2:129"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَنتَ","en_gloss":"You (are)","transliteration":"anta","verse_key":"2:129"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْعَزِيزُ","en_gloss":"the All-Mighty","transliteration":"l-ʿazīzu","verse_key":"2:129"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلْحَكِيمُ","en_gloss":"the All-Wise","transliteration":"l-ḥakīmu","verse_key":"2:129"},{"pos":17,"ar":"١٢٩","en_gloss":"(129)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:129"}]},{"verse_key":"2:130","surah":2,"ayah":130,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَن يَرْغَبُ عَن مِّلَّةِ إِبْرَٰهِـۧمَ إِلَّا مَن سَفِهَ نَفْسَهُۥ ۚ وَلَقَدِ ٱصْطَفَيْنَـٰهُ فِى ٱلدُّنْيَا ۖ وَإِنَّهُۥ فِى ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ لَمِنَ ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Who but a fool would forsake the religion of Abraham? We have chosen him in this world and he will rank among the righteous in the Hereafter.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And who","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"2:130"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَرْغَبُ","en_gloss":"will turn away","transliteration":"yarghabu","verse_key":"2:130"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"2:130"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّلَّةِ","en_gloss":"(the) religion","transliteration":"millati","verse_key":"2:130"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِبْرَٰهِـۧمَ","en_gloss":"(of) Ibrahim","transliteration":"ib'rāhīma","verse_key":"2:130"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"2:130"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"2:130"},{"pos":8,"ar":"سَفِهَ","en_gloss":"fooled","transliteration":"safiha","verse_key":"2:130"},{"pos":9,"ar":"نَفْسَهُۥ ۚ","en_gloss":"himself","transliteration":"nafsahu","verse_key":"2:130"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَقَدِ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"walaqadi","verse_key":"2:130"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱصْطَفَيْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"We chose him","transliteration":"iṣ'ṭafaynāhu","verse_key":"2:130"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:130"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا ۖ","en_gloss":"the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"2:130"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَإ