نَّ إِلَّا وَأَنتُم مُّسْلِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and commanded his sons to do the same, as did Jacob: ‘My sons, God has chosen [your] religion for you, so make sure you devote yourselves to Him, to your dying moment.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَوَصَّىٰ","en_gloss":"And enjoined","transliteration":"wawaṣṣā","verse_key":"2:132"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِهَآ","en_gloss":"[it]","transliteration":"bihā","verse_key":"2:132"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِبْرَٰهِـۧمُ","en_gloss":"Ibrahim","transliteration":"ib'rāhīmu","verse_key":"2:132"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بَنِيهِ","en_gloss":"(upon) his sons","transliteration":"banīhi","verse_key":"2:132"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَيَعْقُوبُ","en_gloss":"and Yaqub","transliteration":"wayaʿqūbu","verse_key":"2:132"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَـٰبَنِىَّ","en_gloss":"O my sons","transliteration":"yābaniyya","verse_key":"2:132"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"2:132"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"2:132"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱصْطَفَىٰ","en_gloss":"has chosen","transliteration":"iṣ'ṭafā","verse_key":"2:132"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَكُمُ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakumu","verse_key":"2:132"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلدِّينَ","en_gloss":"the religion","transliteration":"l-dīna","verse_key":"2:132"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"so not","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"2:132"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَمُوتُنَّ","en_gloss":"(should) you die","transliteration":"tamūtunna","verse_key":"2:132"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"2:132"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَأَنتُم","en_gloss":"while you","transliteration":"wa-antum","verse_key":"2:132"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مُّسْلِمُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) submissive","transliteration":"mus'limūna","verse_key":"2:132"},{"pos":17,"ar":"١٣٢","en_gloss":"(132)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:132"}]},{"verse_key":"2:133","surah":2,"ayah":133,"ar_uthmani":"أَمْ كُنتُمْ شُهَدَآءَ إِذْ حَضَرَ يَعْقُوبَ ٱلْمَوْتُ إِذْ قَالَ لِبَنِيهِ مَا تَعْبُدُونَ مِنۢ بَعْدِى قَالُوا۟ نَعْبُدُ إِلَـٰهَكَ وَإِلَـٰهَ ءَابَآئِكَ إِبْرَٰهِـۧمَ وَإِسْمَـٰعِيلَ وَإِسْحَـٰقَ إِلَـٰهًا وَٰحِدًا وَنَحْنُ لَهُۥ مُسْلِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Were you [Jews] there to see when death came upon Jacob? When he said to his sons, ‘What will you worship after I am gone?’ they replied, ‘We shall worship your God and the God of your fathers, Abraham, Ishmael, and Isaac, one single God: we devote ourselves to Him.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمْ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"2:133"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"were you","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"2:133"},{"pos":3,"ar":"شُهَدَآءَ","en_gloss":"witnesses","transliteration":"shuhadāa","verse_key":"2:133"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"2:133"},{"pos":5,"ar":"حَضَرَ","en_gloss":"came to","transliteration":"ḥaḍara","verse_key":"2:133"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَعْقُوبَ","en_gloss":"Yaqub","transliteration":"yaʿqūba","verse_key":"2:133"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْمَوْتُ","en_gloss":"[the] death","transliteration":"l-mawtu","verse_key":"2:133"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"2:133"},{"pos":9,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"he said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"2:133"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لِبَنِيهِ","en_gloss":"to his sons","transliteration":"libanīhi","verse_key":"2:133"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"What","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:133"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَعْبُدُونَ","en_gloss":"will you worship","transliteration":"taʿbudūna","verse_key":"2:133"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:133"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بَعْدِى","en_gloss":"after me","transliteration":"baʿdī","verse_key":"2:133"},{"pos":15,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"They said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"2:133"},{"pos":16,"ar":"نَعْبُدُ","en_gloss":"We will worship","transliteration":"naʿbudu","verse_key":"2:133"},{"pos":